## 31.6 Sparklines: gtExtras method


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
report <- coffeechain %>%
  mutate(Year = year(Date)) %>%
  filter(Year == "2013") %>%
  mutate (Month = month(Date,
                        label = TRUE,
                        abbr = TRUE)) %>%
  group_by(Product, Month) %>%
  summarise(Sales = sum(Sales)) %>%
  ungroup()
```
:::


::: callout-note
`gtExtras` functions almost exclusively require a data frame with **list columns**. The code chunk below converts the `report` data frame into list columns before passing it to `gt_plt_sparkline()`.
:::


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
report %>%
  group_by(Product) %>%
  summarize('Monthly Sales' = list(Sales),
            .groups = "drop")
```

